{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片｜BIGBANG20周年無人機匯演\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-BIGBANG-DRONE-261112.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】南韓天團BIGBANG為慶祝出道20周年，將於11月13至15日(周五至周日)及17日(下周二)在啟德主場館舉行演唱會。</p><p>為配合這場盛事，主辦方特別安排兩場BIGBANG 20周年香港無人機匯演，於今日晚上8時及11月14日(周六)晚上10時在尖沙咀上演，每場約15分鐘，免費開放觀賞，最佳觀賞地點為尖沙咀海濱長廊。夜空化為巨大舞台，以光影回顧BIGBANG二十年音樂旅程。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:24:02.757000+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:35.532317+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:35.532317+00:00","content_hash":"dc85ca01c77d698f3cec834bb0c53fbfbb7978959a3bb74b843abef650edc6aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}